  "statement": "# Volley Break — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nReturn a ball across a single-screen court, break openings in the shared barrier, and win a complete paddle duel.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA compact 2D sports/action match with paddle control, destructible or changing court structure, scoring, win/loss, and replay.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose the brick layout, ball and rival tuning, hazards, pickups, and set structure.\n"
